      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "auditory",
        "divine",
        "emotion",
        "fear",
        "mental"
      ],
      "text": "Candlaron's echo laments its fate, forcing each living creature within 30 feet to attempt a DC 44 Will save save.\n\nOn a failure, a creature becomes Frightened 2 (or Frightened 3 on a critical failure). On a success, a creature is temporarily immune to the echo's frightful moan for 1 minute."
    },
